{%- comment -%}
  fye-signpost — a pure routing list. One job: get someone to the right guide
  in about three seconds. 1 use: page.jewellery-guides.

  PORTED FROM LIVE 03/09/2026. Setting IDs kept exactly: title, sub, note;
  route blocks keep question, guide, link, icon with the same option values, so
  live's template settings carry over unchanged.

  The large line is the reader's situation in their own words. The guide's real
  title is secondary, because nobody scans "The Diamond and Gemstone Wedding
  Ring Guide" quickly.

  ICONS, and why they are inline rather than from snippets/icon.liquid or from
  Files. Live's note explains the original decision and it still holds: the
  illustration-scale ring artwork collapses into the same grey ring at 46px,
  and there was nothing for a plain band, an eternity band or care. These six
  are drawn at icon weight and differentiated by SILHOUETTE rather than detail,
  which is the only thing that survives at this size: one stone above a band /
  two bands / stones across the top / stones all round / a stone with no band /
  a band with a polish mark.

  They stay inline rather than moving into snippets/icon.liquid because nothing
  else uses them, and icon.liquid is for the shared utility set. If a second
  section ever needs them, move them there rather than copying.

  CHANGED FOR v3:
  - The title renders as an h2, not live's h1. heading-template carries the
    page's only h1 (conventions §7). Live's template left `title` empty and let
    its hero do the same job, so nothing is lost.
  - `.fye-edu-section` schema class dropped: there is no education shell here.
  - The ivory ground and the vertical rhythm come from `band`, so the section
    carries no padding of its own, and the ground is now a palette choice.
  - Tokens throughout, and the 400px breakpoint moved to the theme's 560.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign band = s.band | default: 'ivory'
-%}

{%- capture icon_solitaire -%}
  <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
    <circle cx="16" cy="20.5" r="8.6"/>
    <path d="M16 3.4 20.4 8 16 12.6 11.6 8Z"/>
    <path d="M11.6 8h8.8"/>
  </svg>
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture icon_two_bands -%}
  <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
    <circle cx="11.4" cy="16" r="8.4"/>
    <circle cx="20.6" cy="16" r="8.4"/>
  </svg>
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- comment -%}
  half_set and eternity are the hard pair: both are "a band with stones" and at
  46px an even ring of beads looked identical for both. They are separated by
  texture rather than by count. Half-set gets three chunky faceted stones
  clustered across the top over a plain band; eternity gets ten small even
  beads the whole way round. Do not "tidy" either into the other.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture icon_half_set -%}
  <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
    <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="9"/>
    <path d="M10.2 6.8 12.5 9.1 10.2 11.4 7.9 9.1Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
    <path d="M16 4.7 18.3 7 16 9.3 13.7 7Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
    <path d="M21.8 6.8 24.1 9.1 21.8 11.4 19.5 9.1Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
  </svg>
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture icon_eternity -%}
  <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
    <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="9"/>
    <circle cx="16" cy="7" r="1.25" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
    <circle cx="21.29" cy="8.72" r="1.25" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
    <circle cx="24.56" cy="13.22" r="1.25" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
    <circle cx="24.56" cy="18.78" r="1.25" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
    <circle cx="21.29" cy="23.28" r="1.25" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
    <circle cx="16" cy="25" r="1.25" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
    <circle cx="10.71" cy="23.28" r="1.25" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
    <circle cx="7.44" cy="18.78" r="1.25" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
    <circle cx="7.44" cy="13.22" r="1.25" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
    <circle cx="10.71" cy="8.72" r="1.25" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
  </svg>
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture icon_stone -%}
  <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M10.5 5.5h11l5.5 7.5L16 27.5 5 13Z"/>
    <path d="M5 13h22"/>
    <path d="M10.5 5.5 13.4 13 16 27.5 18.6 13l2.9-7.5"/>
  </svg>
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture icon_care -%}
  <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
    <circle cx="13.5" cy="19" r="8.4"/>
    <path d="M24.6 3.6c.62 3.5 1.02 3.9 4.5 4.5-3.48.62-3.88 1.02-4.5 4.5-.62-3.48-1.02-3.88-4.5-4.5 3.48-.6 3.88-1 4.5-4.5Z"/>
  </svg>
{%- endcapture -%}

<section class="spost band band--{{ band }}" data-screen-label="Guide signpost">
  <div class="wrap spost__inner">

    {%- if s.title != blank -%}
      <div class="sect-head">
        <h2 class="heading-flank">{{ s.title }}</h2>
        {%- if s.sub != blank -%}
          <p class="lead spost__sub">{{ s.sub }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <ul class="spost__list">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- assign b = block.settings -%}
        <li class="spost__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <a class="spost__link" href="{{ b.link }}">
            {%- if b.icon != 'none' -%}
              <span class="spost__figure" aria-hidden="true">
                {%- case b.icon -%}
                  {%- when 'solitaire' -%}{{ icon_solitaire }}
                  {%- when 'two_bands' -%}{{ icon_two_bands }}
                  {%- when 'half_set' -%}{{ icon_half_set }}
                  {%- when 'eternity' -%}{{ icon_eternity }}
                  {%- when 'stone' -%}{{ icon_stone }}
                  {%- when 'care' -%}{{ icon_care }}
                {%- endcase -%}
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="spost__text">
              <span class="spost__situation">{{ b.question }}</span>
              {%- if b.guide != blank -%}
                <span class="spost__guide">{{ b.guide }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
            <span class="spost__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
              {%- render 'icon', name: 'arrow-right', size: 20 -%}
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>

    {%- if s.note != blank -%}
      <div class="fine spost__note">{{ s.note }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
.fye .spost__inner { max-width: 860px; }
.fye .spost__sub { margin: var(--s4) auto 0; max-width: 46em; }

/* The rows bleed to the container edge so the hairlines read as a single
   ruled list rather than a stack of boxes. */
.fye .spost__list {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0 calc(var(--s6) * -1);
  padding: 0;
  border-top: var(--hairline);
}
.fye .spost__item { margin: 0; padding: 0; border-bottom: var(--hairline); }

.fye .spost__link {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--s7);
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 44px;
  padding: var(--s6);
  color: var(--ink);
  background: transparent;
  transition: background-color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}

.fye .spost__figure {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: 46px;
  height: 46px;
  opacity: 0.75;
  transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease), opacity var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .spost__figure :where(svg) { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }

.fye .spost__text { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; }

/* Display face at reading size, sentence case: this is the reader's own
   sentence, so uppercase would make it an announcement instead of a choice. */
.fye .spost__situation {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: var(--fs-h4);
  font-weight: var(--fw-regular);
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: 0.005em;
  text-wrap: pretty;
  transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .spost__guide {
  display: block;
  margin-top: var(--s2);
  font-size: var(--fs-eyebrow);
  font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-eyebrow);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}

.fye .spost__arrow {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  opacity: 0.55;
  transition: transform var(--dur) var(--ease), opacity var(--dur) var(--ease), color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}

/* White on ivory, so the row lifts rather than darkening. */
.fye .spost__link:hover,
.fye .spost__link:focus-visible { background: var(--white); }
.fye .band--white .spost__link:hover,
.fye .band--white .spost__link:focus-visible { background: var(--ivory); }

.fye .spost__link:hover .spost__situation,
.fye .spost__link:focus-visible .spost__situation { color: var(--sage); }
.fye .spost__link:hover .spost__guide,
.fye .spost__link:focus-visible .spost__guide { color: var(--ink); }
.fye .spost__link:hover .spost__figure,
.fye .spost__link:focus-visible .spost__figure { color: var(--sage); opacity: 1; }
.fye .spost__link:hover .spost__arrow,
.fye .spost__link:focus-visible .spost__arrow { transform: translateX(8px); opacity: 1; color: var(--sage); }

.fye .spost__note { margin: var(--s8) 0 0; max-width: 640px; }
.fye .spost__note :where(p:last-child) { margin-bottom: 0; }
.fye .spost__note :where(a) { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

@media (max-width: 749px) {
  .fye .spost__list { margin: 0; }
  .fye .spost__link { padding: var(--s5) 0; gap: var(--s4); }
  .fye .spost__figure { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
  .fye .spost__situation { font-size: var(--fs-body-lg); }
  /* No hover on touch, and the arrow is decoration once the whole row is the
     target, so it goes rather than crowding a narrow line. */
  .fye .spost__arrow { display: none; }
  .fye .spost__link:hover,
  .fye .spost__link:focus-visible { background: transparent; }
}
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .fye .spost__figure { width: 30px; height: 30px; }
  .fye .spost__situation { font-size: var(--fs-body); }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .fye .spost__link,
  .fye .spost__situation,
  .fye .spost__guide,
  .fye .spost__figure,
  .fye .spost__arrow { transition: none; }
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Guide signpost",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "A routing list. Keep each question in the reader's words, not the guide's title."
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Heading",
      "info": "Leave empty when the page banner already carries the title."
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sub", "label": "Sub-heading" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "note", "label": "Quiet note under the list" },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "band", "label": "Background", "default": "ivory",
      "options": [
        { "value": "white", "label": "White" },
        { "value": "ivory", "label": "Champagne ivory" },
        { "value": "mist", "label": "Mist blue" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "route",
      "name": "Route",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text", "id": "question", "label": "The reader's situation",
          "info": "The large line. Plain words, first person."
        },
        { "type": "text", "id": "guide", "label": "Guide name" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "link", "label": "Link" },
        {
          "type": "select", "id": "icon", "label": "Icon", "default": "solitaire",
          "options": [
            { "value": "solitaire", "label": "Solitaire, one stone above a band" },
            { "value": "two_bands", "label": "Two plain bands" },
            { "value": "half_set", "label": "Stones across the top" },
            { "value": "eternity", "label": "Stones all the way round" },
            { "value": "stone", "label": "A cut stone, no band" },
            { "value": "care", "label": "Band with a polish mark" },
            { "value": "none", "label": "No icon" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 10,
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Guide signpost",
      "blocks": [{ "type": "route" }, { "type": "route" }, { "type": "route" }]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
